						 <p><sub>&lt;_&lt; didn't this show and its memeness die in like 2010</sub></p> <p>I am in really downward-leaning novote territory here. There's really no <em>content</em> here, but I'm trying to remember that Project Crossover is gimmicky and doesn't really require narratives. Only reason I'm not downvoting is that I know I just flat-out don't like Llamas With Hats (it has always been unfunny to me), so I know I probably can't take an objective look at quality of content for a stable vote decision. Just not my cup of tea, I guess.</p> 
